            # Django-pair generation specification                              
                                                                                
            > **PROVENANCE WARNING.** Unlike the Flask specification, this text 
            does not                                                            
            > appear anywhere in the manuscript or in any earlier version of the
            > replication package. The manuscript only *describes* it:          
            "rephrased to                                                       
            > Django's request and response model", covering five behavioural   
            areas (URL                                                          
            > resolution, request object behaviour, view dispatch, response     
            handling,                                                           
            > class-based view behaviour), with templating, application context 
            and                                                                 
            > Blueprints excluded as having no counterpart in the Django URL    
            module.                                                             
            >                                                                   
            > What follows is a reconstruction from that description, written to
            match the                                                           
            > Flask specification's structure, level of detail, and deliberate  
            silences                                                            
            > (it fixes behaviour and the WSGI interface, and names no API      
            symbols beyond                                                      
            > those the behaviour requires). **It is not the original.** If the 
            original                                                            
            > text still exists, replace this file with it before generating,   
