            4. Response Handling\\n- Response objects with status code, headers,
            and body\\n- Automatic content-type handling\\n- WSGI-compliant     
            response generation\\n\\n### 5. Class-Based Views\\n- Method        
            dispatch based on HTTP verbs (GET, POST, PUT, etc.)\\n- Automatic   
