            = \'value\'\\n    return response\\n```\\n\\n## API                 
            Reference\\n\\n### URL Patterns\\n\\n#### `path(route, view,        
            name=None)`\\nCreate a URL pattern with Django-style parameter      
            syntax.\\n\\n- `route`: URL pattern with `<converter:name>`         
            syntax\\n- `view`: View function or class-based view\\n- `name`:    
            Optional name for the pattern\\n\\n#### `re_path(regex, view,       
