            +```                                                                
            +djangoframework/                                                   
            +├── __init__.py          # Package exports                         
            +├── http.py              # HttpRequest, HttpResponse classes       
            +├── urls.py              # URL patterns, converters, routing       
            +├── views.py             # Class-based View system                 
